  "summary": "EFF announces an updated edition of its zine 'Surveillance Technology at the U.S.-Mexico Border,' a 40-page guide identifying border surveillance tech including towers, military equipment, and disguised trail cams and automated license plate readers. The post describes the research behind the zine and how it is distributed to journalists, humanitarians, and EFF members.",
